WEBVTT

00:06.630 --> 00:09.380
[♪ theme music]

01:37.090 --> 01:39.510
[all grunting]

01:44.470 --> 01:47.390
[breathes heavily]

01:52.400 --> 01:58.030
Again and again, my well-thought-out plans
have been destroyed by Hanagaki.

01:58.660 --> 02:01.070
Now that I can't use Mikey,

02:01.160 --> 02:03.950
my only choice is
to use Izana as my instrument.

02:04.040 --> 02:05.450
[breathes heavily]

02:05.540 --> 02:08.750
Kakucho, you're in my way, damn it!

02:10.420 --> 02:11.670
Kisaki…

02:11.750 --> 02:14.250
[heaves, groans]

02:15.760 --> 02:16.760
I knew it.

02:17.800 --> 02:20.510
I never should have let you near Izana.

02:23.140 --> 02:25.180
[screams]

02:25.640 --> 02:26.720
Die.

02:26.810 --> 02:28.810
[gunshots]

02:28.890 --> 02:30.020
[gasps]

02:30.980 --> 02:32.270
[gasps]

02:38.320 --> 02:39.320
What?!

02:39.450 --> 02:40.570
[gasps]

02:47.580 --> 02:48.870
Izana!

02:50.040 --> 02:52.330
[bullet clatters]

02:53.420 --> 02:54.630
Why?

02:55.090 --> 02:56.630
Why would you do that?

02:57.170 --> 02:59.050
Why did you protect your servant?

02:59.130 --> 03:01.970
[breathes heavily]

03:03.510 --> 03:04.510
Izana.

03:05.220 --> 03:06.720
[Izana] You idiot.

03:08.890 --> 03:10.850
What the hell are you doing?

03:11.390 --> 03:12.520
[chokes]

03:13.730 --> 03:14.940
Damn it.

03:15.820 --> 03:17.900
For a servant, you're a real pain.

03:19.650 --> 03:20.700
My body…

03:22.700 --> 03:24.450
acted all on its own.

03:24.530 --> 03:26.200
[gasps]

03:26.280 --> 03:27.410
[gulps]

03:27.490 --> 03:30.160
[gasping]

03:34.830 --> 03:35.840
Mikey…

03:35.920 --> 03:36.960
[grunts]

03:37.050 --> 03:41.050
[Izana] There's something…
I want to tell you.

03:42.340 --> 03:43.340
Tenjiku

03:44.260 --> 03:45.260
has lost.

03:46.430 --> 03:47.430
Izana…

03:48.060 --> 03:49.270
Cut that out, damn it!

03:49.680 --> 03:51.060
I can say that,

03:51.560 --> 03:53.440
but you don't need to!

03:53.520 --> 03:55.150
[chuckles]

03:55.810 --> 03:57.070
Don't be stupid.

03:58.150 --> 04:00.030
I really don't get you.

04:00.110 --> 04:02.360
Why did you protect me, Izana?

04:03.070 --> 04:05.320
Why protect someone like me?

04:05.410 --> 04:06.910
You're the king!

04:07.370 --> 04:11.660
No matter who you forsake
and no matter how many you sacrifice,

04:11.750 --> 04:14.370
you have to create your era!

04:14.920 --> 04:18.290
That's what a king is, Izana!

04:19.750 --> 04:21.880
It's not my era.

04:24.180 --> 04:26.470
It's our era.

04:26.890 --> 04:27.970
Huh?

04:28.760 --> 04:30.270
Sorry, Kakucho.

04:31.390 --> 04:32.390
But…

04:34.020 --> 04:35.190
you are…

04:36.900 --> 04:38.730
all I have.

04:42.240 --> 04:43.860
[sobs]

04:43.950 --> 04:45.240
[gang member 1] I can't see.

04:45.320 --> 04:47.820
-[gang member 2] What the hell's going on?
-[gang member 3] What was that noise?

04:47.910 --> 04:49.410
Call an ambulance!

04:49.490 --> 04:51.740
-The leader was shot?
-By who?

04:51.830 --> 04:53.120
Kakucho too?

04:53.790 --> 04:55.210
Tenjiku's through!

04:55.290 --> 04:58.170
[indistinct chatter]

04:58.250 --> 04:59.710
[both exclaim quietly]

05:00.710 --> 05:02.590
Izana… Kakucho!

05:02.670 --> 05:04.550
[gasps]

05:10.640 --> 05:11.970
[soft grunt]

05:17.100 --> 05:18.350
[Izana] Mikey.

05:19.480 --> 05:23.530
Did you say… that you want to save me?

05:23.610 --> 05:25.490
We're brothers, so of course.

05:26.400 --> 05:28.070
Don't talk, Izana.

05:28.160 --> 05:29.450
[Izana] You said so, right?

05:31.580 --> 05:35.750
Both Emma and I loved Shinichiro.

05:35.830 --> 05:38.710
[panting]

05:38.790 --> 05:41.790
Just like you did.

05:41.880 --> 05:44.130
[panting continues]

05:47.180 --> 05:49.010
[sighs deeply]

05:50.470 --> 05:53.350
[♪ somber music]

05:57.690 --> 05:58.980
[giggles]

06:03.270 --> 06:05.150
DEAR SHINICHIRO

06:12.370 --> 06:13.530
[Izana] One day…

06:16.040 --> 06:19.250
I ran into… my mother.

06:21.790 --> 06:24.250
The person… who abandoned me.

06:36.220 --> 06:38.310
What's wrong, Izana?

06:39.060 --> 06:41.230
-Go on ahead home.
-Huh?

06:41.310 --> 06:43.190
PACHINKO

06:45.980 --> 06:48.360
[indistinct chatter]

06:48.900 --> 06:52.120
It wasn't like what we have at home.

06:52.200 --> 06:53.830
-Is that right?
-[child] It was kind of…

06:53.910 --> 06:57.540
[child chattering indistinctly]

07:05.040 --> 07:07.050
[machines beeping and whirring]

07:10.130 --> 07:11.380
Mom.

07:13.090 --> 07:14.180
[Izana] Mom.

07:15.010 --> 07:16.220
Right?

07:19.520 --> 07:22.940
How come you never come to visit me?

07:32.070 --> 07:34.530
Did you abandon me?

07:37.410 --> 07:38.410
Why?

07:47.170 --> 07:49.630
Was it so you could do this?

07:50.420 --> 07:52.010
[puffs]

07:54.220 --> 07:55.470
What a pain.

07:55.550 --> 07:56.930
Huh?

07:57.010 --> 07:59.640
You're not my kid.

08:01.020 --> 08:02.190
What?

08:02.770 --> 08:07.110
You're the son of my ex-husband
and his Filipino ex-wife.

08:08.730 --> 08:10.820
[Emma's mother]
He was good-for-nothing scum.

08:11.490 --> 08:14.530
He ended up getting stabbed
by some thug and dying.

08:15.160 --> 08:16.200
Get it?

08:16.620 --> 08:18.490
You're my stepchild.

08:18.990 --> 08:21.000
We're not related.

08:21.500 --> 08:23.500
[♪ dramatic music]

08:24.460 --> 08:25.960
[soft gasp]

08:29.050 --> 08:30.090
[Izana] <i>Huh?</i>

08:33.720 --> 08:36.890
[screams]

08:42.100 --> 08:44.730
[panting]

08:44.810 --> 08:47.100
You knew, didn't you, Shinichiro?

08:47.190 --> 08:48.900
Why didn't you tell me?

08:54.950 --> 08:58.070
[Shinichiro] Yeah, I realized it.

08:58.870 --> 09:02.080
But that stuff doesn't matter.

09:02.160 --> 09:04.120
"Doesn't matter"?

09:04.210 --> 09:05.710
That's what's most important!

09:06.540 --> 09:08.000
Why, Izana?

09:08.380 --> 09:13.420
Even if we're not blood relatives,
that doesn't change things between us.

09:13.510 --> 09:16.760
Shut up!

09:20.260 --> 09:21.430
Why…

09:22.560 --> 09:24.810
Why did you ever have to show up?
[Izana sobbing]

09:26.730 --> 09:29.310
If I knew I was alone,
I could have handled it.

09:30.190 --> 09:32.730
Can you understand this, Shinichiro?

09:33.400 --> 09:38.280
The hell of having the happiness
you thought you had suddenly ripped away.

09:42.370 --> 09:44.370
[♪ somber music]

09:46.210 --> 09:48.920
Can you… understand…

09:49.920 --> 09:51.630
how I feel?

09:52.300 --> 09:55.170
Izana, you…

09:55.260 --> 09:57.380
Huh? That means…

09:58.090 --> 09:59.760
[gasps]

09:59.840 --> 10:00.890
[Izana] That's right.

10:02.220 --> 10:04.850
I'm not a brother to Shinichiro

10:05.600 --> 10:07.980
or you or Emma.

10:08.690 --> 10:12.320
I'm not related to anyone.

10:12.820 --> 10:14.690
[groans]

10:15.440 --> 10:16.860
You must be joking.

10:17.490 --> 10:18.860
[gasps]

10:18.950 --> 10:20.820
[whimpers]

10:21.870 --> 10:23.080
Tell me, Mikey…

10:24.410 --> 10:27.290
Can you save me?

10:28.080 --> 10:30.250
[breathes deeply]

10:32.960 --> 10:35.000
I'm beyond saving, right?

10:35.090 --> 10:36.380
[gasps]

10:38.720 --> 10:39.880
Right?

10:40.640 --> 10:43.550
Emma…

10:43.640 --> 10:45.770
[inaudible]

10:50.600 --> 10:51.850
[inhales deeply]

10:53.730 --> 10:54.820
Izana?

11:03.370 --> 11:05.240
[exhales deeply]

11:05.330 --> 11:07.200
[breathes deeply]

11:07.290 --> 11:09.160
[whimpers]

11:09.250 --> 11:12.790
[sobbing]

11:14.000 --> 11:15.210
Izana!

11:15.290 --> 11:16.300
[grunts]

11:16.880 --> 11:18.420
[gasps]

11:18.510 --> 11:19.670
Hey!

11:20.930 --> 11:22.180
Answer me!

11:23.390 --> 11:25.300
[Kakucho] Hey! Izana!

11:25.930 --> 11:27.560
Hey!

11:28.220 --> 11:29.640
Kaku-chan…

11:29.730 --> 11:30.890
[Kakucho] Izana…

11:30.980 --> 11:33.600
[sobbing continues]

11:35.310 --> 11:37.690
[coughs]

11:40.110 --> 11:42.110
[grunts, pants]

11:47.620 --> 11:49.870
[♪ somber music]

11:52.210 --> 11:55.000
[Kakucho] Izana… [sobbing]

11:55.080 --> 11:57.380
I won't let you be alone.

11:57.880 --> 12:01.670
Soon, I'll be joining you

12:02.090 --> 12:03.090
over there.

12:07.850 --> 12:09.100
I guess

12:10.100 --> 12:12.100
we sucked at living, huh?

12:12.180 --> 12:14.900
[sobbing] Kaku-chan.

12:15.400 --> 12:18.020
[♪ somber music]

12:22.190 --> 12:23.820
[soft gasp]

12:27.530 --> 12:28.780
[Kakucho] Snow…

12:30.790 --> 12:32.790
[breathes shakily]

12:36.920 --> 12:38.960
[panting]

12:42.210 --> 12:43.420
-Snow!
-Snow!

12:46.390 --> 12:48.010
[grunts, laughs]

12:49.470 --> 12:50.970
That's not fair, Izana!

12:51.060 --> 12:53.640
We agreed that
the line marks my territory.

12:53.730 --> 12:54.770
Dummy!

12:54.850 --> 12:57.020
Promises are meant to be broken.

12:57.690 --> 12:58.980
[Kakucho yells]

12:59.060 --> 13:01.400
That's the snowman I made!

13:01.480 --> 13:02.650
[Izana] Sorry.

13:02.740 --> 13:05.070
I was going to help, but it broke.

13:05.150 --> 13:06.240
You're so mean!

13:06.320 --> 13:08.450
I'm going to play by myself.

13:08.530 --> 13:10.830
Now, now. Don't be like that.

13:11.330 --> 13:12.870
Let's make an igloo.

13:14.790 --> 13:15.920
[Kakucho] We did it!

13:16.960 --> 13:18.710
This is our country's castle.

13:19.080 --> 13:20.540
Our country?

13:20.880 --> 13:22.000
Yeah.

13:23.380 --> 13:24.470
[Izana] Look.

13:24.550 --> 13:26.630
This is our top-secret plan.

13:27.050 --> 13:29.850
We'll put this into action
by the time we're adults

13:29.930 --> 13:31.680
and build the strongest country.

13:32.260 --> 13:34.930
"Death to anyone who disobeys"?

13:35.020 --> 13:36.140
Isn't that awful harsh?

13:36.230 --> 13:37.440
Nothing wrong with that.

13:37.520 --> 13:39.150
I'm the king, after all.

13:39.230 --> 13:42.320
[Kakucho] Since I'm your servant,
am I the prime minister?

13:42.400 --> 13:43.980
[Izana] No, you moron.

13:44.070 --> 13:46.110
Do you even know what servant means?

13:46.740 --> 13:48.610
I work for you, right?

13:48.700 --> 13:49.740
Oh…

13:50.490 --> 13:51.660
[chuckles]

13:51.740 --> 13:52.910
Hm.

13:52.990 --> 13:54.290
Let me see.

13:54.830 --> 13:57.500
I'll give you a squad.

13:57.580 --> 13:59.290
A squad?

13:59.790 --> 14:01.630
You'll fight for our country.

14:02.630 --> 14:05.550
Everyone who doesn't have
a family will be citizens.

14:05.630 --> 14:07.550
We'll make a home for all of them.

14:08.880 --> 14:09.890
[clicks]

14:12.430 --> 14:15.350
Citizens, pay taxes to me!

14:15.770 --> 14:17.770
-Like that.
-[laughs]

14:17.850 --> 14:19.520
Nice. That's so like you.

14:20.730 --> 14:24.480
So from now on, we can't lose.

14:25.030 --> 14:28.990
Right. Then we can't lose even once, huh?

14:32.450 --> 14:33.950
[Kakucho grunts]

14:34.030 --> 14:35.160
What'll we call the country?

14:35.240 --> 14:36.870
[sighs]

14:36.950 --> 14:38.210
Let me see.

14:39.420 --> 14:43.290
If I'm Sanzo Hoshi, then you're Son Goku.

14:43.380 --> 14:46.010
Really? You mean from <i>Journey to the West</i>?

14:47.090 --> 14:50.470
So our kingdom's name is Tenjiku.

14:51.340 --> 14:52.850
Tenjiku, huh?

14:53.390 --> 14:56.970
We'll create a great era for sure.

14:58.480 --> 15:00.770
[♪ dramatic music]

15:17.830 --> 15:20.620
[sobbing]

15:22.290 --> 15:23.290
Kaku-chan!

15:30.800 --> 15:32.260
[Mikey] <i>Shinichiro…</i>

15:36.060 --> 15:38.640
Everyone from Toman and Tenjiku,
listen up!

15:39.480 --> 15:42.100
This conflict is over.

15:42.190 --> 15:43.810
[gang members gasp]

15:45.860 --> 15:47.360
Get out of here right now.

15:48.030 --> 15:49.650
I'll stay behind and clear things up.

15:50.240 --> 15:51.240
[Mikey] Dismissed!

15:52.570 --> 15:54.070
Is it really over?

15:54.160 --> 15:55.410
Yeah, it is.

15:56.120 --> 15:57.870
Get a move on!

15:57.950 --> 15:59.240
[Mucho] Mikey.

15:59.370 --> 16:02.210
You get out of here too.

16:02.750 --> 16:04.290
We'll stay behind.

16:05.000 --> 16:06.170
You guys…

16:08.550 --> 16:12.630
We each supported Izana
for our own purposes.

16:13.630 --> 16:14.930
But the truth is

16:15.550 --> 16:19.180
we probably admired
the way you two guys lived.

16:24.190 --> 16:27.820
We saw how you lived to the end, Captain.

16:27.900 --> 16:30.530
[sobbing]

16:34.610 --> 16:35.820
Now then…

16:36.910 --> 16:38.200
[gasps]

16:38.870 --> 16:42.710
[panting]

16:46.420 --> 16:47.920
You alone though,

16:49.040 --> 16:51.260
I cannot forgive, Kisaki.

16:55.300 --> 16:56.890
You alone though,

16:57.640 --> 17:00.100
I cannot forgive, Kisaki.

17:00.600 --> 17:02.470
[gasps, grunts]

17:03.020 --> 17:05.890
[Takemichi] <i>That's right. Him alone…</i>

17:06.520 --> 17:09.150
[panting]

17:15.200 --> 17:16.740
[both grunt]

17:16.820 --> 17:17.870
Kisaki!

17:18.820 --> 17:20.280
Got you!

17:20.370 --> 17:21.910
[all grunt]

17:22.910 --> 17:25.660
You owe me one, Kisaki.

17:27.330 --> 17:28.420
[Takemichi] <i>Damn!</i>

17:28.500 --> 17:30.130
<i>He'll get away!</i>

17:30.210 --> 17:32.760
<i>If he gets away,
the same stuff will keep happening!</i>

17:32.840 --> 17:33.880
[motorcycle engine revs]

17:33.960 --> 17:35.380
-[Draken] Takemitchy!
-[grunts]

17:35.470 --> 17:37.260
Get on! We're going after him!

17:37.340 --> 17:38.510
[Takemichi] Draken!

17:42.100 --> 17:43.270
Hina…

17:44.350 --> 17:45.810
[Takemichi] <i>I can't leave her here.</i>

17:46.560 --> 17:49.560
Takemitchy, leave Hina to me!

17:49.650 --> 17:51.570
[Mikey] Do what you have to do!

17:52.150 --> 17:53.190
Right!

17:56.780 --> 17:59.070
Hold on tight, Takemitchy!

17:59.160 --> 18:00.160
Will do!

18:02.370 --> 18:05.500
[Naoto] <i>I know you can save my sister.</i>

18:06.210 --> 18:09.460
[Takemichi]
<i>Naoto, I've finally got him cornered.</i>

18:10.330 --> 18:13.170
<i>Just to take over Toman, he killed Draken.</i>

18:13.800 --> 18:15.260
<i>He manipulated Kazutora</i>

18:15.340 --> 18:17.010
<i>and had Baji killed.</i>

18:17.090 --> 18:19.380
<i>In the future, he even killed Chifuyu.</i>

18:20.300 --> 18:22.510
<i>He wrecked the Shiba siblings.</i>

18:22.600 --> 18:24.180
<i>He killed Naoto.</i>

18:24.260 --> 18:26.060
<i>He killed Emma.</i>

18:26.140 --> 18:27.140
<i>Izana</i>

18:27.640 --> 18:29.100
<i>and Kaku-chan too.</i>

18:30.310 --> 18:31.440
<i>He's also</i>

18:32.110 --> 18:34.530
<i>the culprit who keeps killing Hina.</i>

18:35.190 --> 18:37.440
I swear I won't let him get away!

18:39.820 --> 18:43.200
<i>If he gets away now, he'll travel
through time again and ruin everything!</i>

18:43.280 --> 18:45.160
[engine roaring]

18:47.830 --> 18:48.830
[Kisaki] Hanma!

18:48.910 --> 18:52.500
-Drive faster! They'll catch us!
-Damn it! Don't yank!

18:52.580 --> 18:55.340
[brakes screeches]

18:55.420 --> 18:57.550
[grunting]

18:57.630 --> 18:59.550
[loud crashing]

19:04.600 --> 19:06.220
[groans]

19:07.390 --> 19:09.180
[grunts, gasps]

19:09.270 --> 19:11.150
[grunts]

19:11.230 --> 19:13.230
[♪ tense music stings]

19:15.150 --> 19:18.240
Please save my sister.

19:18.820 --> 19:21.660
[Takemichi] <i>Naoto, we're almost there.</i>

19:22.280 --> 19:24.410
[groaning]

19:24.490 --> 19:26.160
[breathes heavily]

19:26.240 --> 19:28.370
At last, I've caught up with you,

19:28.830 --> 19:29.830
Kisaki!

19:29.910 --> 19:31.580
[panting]

19:37.090 --> 19:38.170
Stop, damn it!

19:38.260 --> 19:40.300
[groans]

19:41.590 --> 19:42.590
[grunts]

19:44.850 --> 19:46.470
[Takemichi] <i>My foot that got shot…</i>

19:47.180 --> 19:48.180
[gasps]

19:48.270 --> 19:49.730
Get on my back.

19:50.520 --> 19:52.520
[panting]

19:53.480 --> 19:55.610
[♪ thrilling music]

19:57.230 --> 19:58.400
Damn it!

20:01.700 --> 20:02.950
Sorry, Draken.

20:03.700 --> 20:04.950
It's only fair.

20:06.160 --> 20:08.580
-It was the other way around before.
-Huh?

20:08.660 --> 20:10.580
When Kiyomasa stabbed me.

20:13.460 --> 20:14.500
[gasps]

20:16.130 --> 20:18.050
You knew, didn't you?

20:20.090 --> 20:21.760
That I would die.

20:21.840 --> 20:22.880
[grunts]

20:24.640 --> 20:26.850
I don't know what happened in the future,

20:27.640 --> 20:30.060
but I do know
that you've been fighting desperately.

20:31.270 --> 20:32.520
[Draken] He's behind all of it?

20:33.060 --> 20:34.060
Yes!

20:36.520 --> 20:38.820
[gasps]
Draken, behind you!

20:38.900 --> 20:41.400
[yells]

20:42.190 --> 20:43.530
-[loud clank]
-[grunts]

20:44.990 --> 20:46.320
Can you run, Takemitchy?

20:46.410 --> 20:49.200
Yes! Even if my leg's busted, I'll run!

20:50.740 --> 20:53.370
-Leave this to me!
-Got it!

20:53.460 --> 20:55.500
[Takemichi pants]

20:56.960 --> 20:59.630
[grunting]

21:02.130 --> 21:04.680
-Now then, you goddamn zombie.
-[crackles]

21:05.340 --> 21:07.340
I'll smash you to bits today.

21:08.890 --> 21:10.470
[Hanma snickers]

21:10.560 --> 21:13.810
I'll hang your damn braid on your grave.

21:13.890 --> 21:16.270
[♪ dramatic music]

21:16.350 --> 21:18.230
[pants, grunts]

21:21.530 --> 21:22.820
Damn it!

21:22.900 --> 21:25.740
[panting]

21:38.710 --> 21:40.090
[breathes heavily]

21:41.000 --> 21:42.420
[screams]

21:46.590 --> 21:48.890
[grunting]

21:52.180 --> 21:53.520
[grunts]

21:54.640 --> 21:57.480
[screams]

21:57.560 --> 22:00.480
[both grunting]

